    "detailed_description": "Point Rescue Arcade hearkens back to light gun shooters of the 90's.  Bright, chunky graphics and fast mindless action.  Uncover the dodgy dealings of City 2 through various missions in a variety of bright and colourful environments.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086800/extras/ba426d4ba5c729bfdab7f16c8353c124.poster.avif?t=1712524962\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086800/extras/ba426d4ba5c729bfdab7f16c8353c124.webm?t=1712524962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086800/extras/ba426d4ba5c729bfdab7f16c8353c124.mp4?t=1712524962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Retro graphics<br></li><li>Body based hit detection and enemy reactions<br></li><li>Dynamic mode where you improve your weapons and each play through offers different levels.<br></li><li>Multiple weapons<br></li><li>Amateur voice acting<br></li><li>Midi-styled soundtrack<br></li><li>Support for modern light guns </li></ul>",
